</style></head><body><header><div class="eyebrow">NK MobileApps / Android games</div><h1>Get to know your next move.</h1><p>Short, practical guides to our virtual-coin games. Find a control, choose a goal and return to the game.</p><div class="notice"><strong>For adults 18+.</strong> Simulated casino games. Virtual coins have no cash value. No real-money gambling, cash prizes or cashout. Outcomes vary.</div><nav aria-label="Game guides"><a href="#velvet">Velvet auto spin</a><a href="#neon">Neon missions &amp; City Tour</a><a href="#dragon">Dragon Daily Wheel</a></nav></header><main>
<section class="game" id="velvet"><div class="eyebrow">Velvet Spotlight / version 0.4.3</div><h2>How to start and stop auto spin</h2><div class="guidegrid"><div><ol><li><strong>Choose your bet.</strong> Auto spin uses virtual coins at the selected bet. Bets unlock as you level up.</li><li><strong>Press and hold SPIN to start.</strong> The control changes to STOP AUTO while auto spin is running.</li><li><strong>Tap STOP AUTO to stop.</strong> You do not need to choose a 10, 20 or 30-spin batch.</li></ol><p>Auto spin is a convenience control, not a way to guarantee a win. Keep an eye on your selected bet and coin balance.</p><details><summary>Where are my theatre projects and cue game?</summary><p>Open Settings to reach Projects, Atelier and Showtime Cue. Collect props through play, invest them in the three projects for each venue, and repeat the symbol sequence in the cue game.</p></details><details><summary>Are these real-money rewards?</summary><p>No. Coins and rewards have no real-world value. Optional coin packs are available when Google Play supplies a price. Buying coins does not make rewards redeemable for cash.</p></details><a class="button" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=nir.com.velvetspotlight&amp;utm_source=nk_website&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=game_guides">View Velvet Spotlight on Google Play</a></div><figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="360" height="800" alt="Velvet Spotlight emulator screen with five reels, a selected bet and the STOP AUTO control"><figcaption>Emulator demonstration of the 0.4.3 controls, captured from a debug build with a sample Test Ad. This is a still image, not a gameplay video or a physical-device store capture. It does not verify live ad serving or purchases.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="game" id="neon"><div class="eyebrow">Neon Vegas Slots / version 1.3.7</div><h2>Find a goal in Missions and City Tour</h2><ol><li><strong>Open Missions.</strong> Check daily and weekly goals, plus lifetime achievements. Read the actual objective before you play.</li><li><strong>Play towards an objective.</strong> Ordinary spins may advance a matching objective. A win is not guaranteed on any spin.</li><li><strong>Open City Tour.</strong> The released game has four destinations that unlock as you level up, with twelve collection trophies. It is not a 100-stage map.</li></ol><p>Neon uses five reels, three rows and five paylines. Optional coin packs may be offered through Google Play; all coins remain virtual and cannot be cashed out.</p><a class="button" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=nir.com.neonvegasslots&amp;utm_source=nk_website&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=game_guides">View Neon Vegas Slots on Google Play</a></section>
<section class="game" id="dragon"><div class="eyebrow">Dragon Gold Slots</div><h2>How does the Daily Wheel work?</h2><p>The Daily Wheel gives an in-game virtual-coin reward when it is available. Open the wheel, spin and collect the displayed reward. The result varies: a reward shown in a demonstration is an example, not a guaranteed prize.</p><p>See the controls in our existing <a href="https://youtube.com/shorts/a8XEj9zuw_4">Daily Wheel demonstration on YouTube</a>, or watch the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OIugkjtJYz4">five-payline and spin-quest guide</a>. YouTube requires viewers to be signed in and over 18 for these videos. No video is embedded or set to autoplay here.</p><a class="button" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=nir.com.dragongoldslots&amp;utm_source=nk_website&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=game_guides">View Dragon Gold Slots on Google Play</a></section>
<section><h3>Before you play</h3><p>These guides describe the versions named above, checked on 25 November 2026. Controls may change in later releases.</p><p>For more demonstrations, visit <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@NKMobileApps">NK MobileApps on YouTube</a>. This page does not ask for sign-in, contacts or payment details and adds no analytics scripts.</p></section></main><footer>NK MobileApps · Game guides · Adults 18+<br>Virtual coins only. Playing a simulated casino game does not imply future success at real-money gambling.</footer></body></html>
